4: //
5: // Renders review_mode_contract.yaml into a human-readable Markdown snapshot.
6: // This is the single real render target declared under the manifest's
7: // render.artifacts — every other file that mentions this contract's
8: // taxonomy is hand-authored (see authoredArtifacts in the manifest) and is
9: // not touched by this script.
