12: // subset actually used by review_mode_contract.yaml (block mappings, block
13: // sequences of scalars or inline maps, inline flow lists, quoted/plain
14: // scalars, booleans, numbers, full-line comments). No block scalars,
15: // anchors, tags, or multi-document markers are supported because the source
16: // file does not use them; js-yaml is not a reachable dependency from this
17: // script's runtime path, so this parser avoids adding one for a single
18: // consumer.
